		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=8439#p8439"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Indexes:<br />&#160; &#160; &quot;stroke_coord_key&quot; gist (coord)<br />&#160; &#160; &quot;stroke_date_key&quot; btree (date)<br />&#160; &#160; &quot;stroke_num_key&quot; btree (num)<br />Check constraints:<br />&#160; &#160; &quot;enforce_dims_coord&quot; CHECK (ndims(coord) = 2)<br />&#160; &#160; &quot;enforce_geotype_coord&quot; CHECK (geometrytype(coord) = &#039;POINT&#039;::text OR coord IS NULL)<br />&#160; &#160; &quot;enforce_srid_coord&quot; CHECK (srid(coord) = 4326)</p>]]></content>
