		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=8436#p8436"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>désolé je n&#039;avais pas capté</p><p>voici le résultat :</p><p>EXPLAIN ANALYZE select date, x(coord), y(coord) from ldb.stroke where insertdate between &#039;2011-03-15 09:37:00.679191&#039; and &#039;2011-03-15 09:37:05.073541&#039; and coord &amp;&amp; st_setsrid(&#039;BOX(-180 -90, 180 90)&#039;::box2d,4326);<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; QUERY PLAN&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> Seq Scan on stroke&#160; (cost=0.00..1528695.10 rows=1 width=33) (actual time=681410.009..684291.580 rows=5 loops=1)<br />&#160; &#160;Filter: ((insertdate &gt;= &#039;2011-03-15 09:37:00.679191&#039;::timestamp without time zone) AND (insertdate &lt;= &#039;2011-03-15 09:37:05.073541&#039;::timestamp without time zone) AND (coord &amp;&amp; &#039;0103000020E6100000010000000500000000000000008066C000000000008056C000000000008066<br />C0000000000080564000000000008066400000000000805640000000000080664000000000008056<br />C000000000008066C000000000008056C0&#039;::geometry))<br /> Total runtime: 684306.400 ms<br />(3 rows)</p>]]></content>
